+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// ② C3 캐시 view — 구현은 ggml-moe-direct.cpp (캐시 상태 소유자)
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+// dispatcher drain + mutation epoch 동결 + (record, slot, generation, ptr) view 구성.
