+// COMDAT today, and keeping it inline keeps it one (spec section 3-2, row 1).
+//
+// Self-contained by contract (spec section 3-2, side contract 1): ggml_context,
+// ggml_cgraph, ggml_tensor and ggml_free are owned by the engine's public header, so this
+// file includes it rather than leaning on the monolith's prelude.
